---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getCorporateData } from '../lib/cms';

const corp = getCorporateData();
const historyHero = "https://ikosluxurydevelopments.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/IMG_2989-1.jpg";
---

<Layout title="The Chronicles — IKOS Luxury Developments" description="The story of how high-fashion curation fused with rigorous project precision to bring European sophistication to Calgary's architecture.">
  
  <!-- HISTORY HERO (Light Luxury Style) -->
  <section class="relative w-full h-[45vh] overflow-hidden flex items-end bg-linen border-b border-bronze/10">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src={historyHero} 
        alt="Bespoke Architectural Sketching" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-15" 
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-linen via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12 w-full pb-12">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-3">
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-bronze-dark max-w-8"></span>
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-epic text-bronze-dark font-semibold">THE CHRONICLES OF IKOS</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif text-obsidian tracking-tight uppercase">Our History & Heritage</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- INTRODUCTORY REFLECTIONS -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-linen relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-dark block font-semibold mb-3">01 — THE GENESIS</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-obsidian tracking-tight leading-tight uppercase">
          Where Curation <br />
          <span class="italic font-light text-bronze-dark">Meets Absolute Precision</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed font-light font-sans">
        <p>
          IKOS was born out of a shared realization in the foothills of Southern Alberta: that luxury residential architecture had lost its visual and structural cohesion. Standard high-end homes were being framed as speculative products rather than visual art, sacrificing material honesty and tailored curation for rapid turnaround schedules.
        </p>
        <p>
          We believed Calgary deserved a different path. We envisioned a design-build atelier modeled on the legendary fashion houses of Paris and the rigorous engineering firms of Frankfurt. By merging these two seemingly disparate worlds—high-fashion curation and bulletproof financial operations—IKOS emerged to redefine Western Canadian architecture.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE DUAL INHERITAGE: THE UNION OF OPPOSITES -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white/40 border-y border-bronze/10 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
      
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-epic text-bronze-dark block font-semibold mb-2">THE COMPLEMENTARY DUUMVIRATE</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-obsidian tracking-tight uppercase">The Fusion of Two Legacies</h2>
        <p class="text-[10px] text-obsidian/50 uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Elena's Heritage of Aesthetics & Stamos's Heritage of Operations</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12">
        
        <!-- Elena's Side -->
        <div class="space-y-4 bg-white/60 border border-bronze/10 p-8 relative group hover:border-bronze-dark transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-0.5 bg-bronze-dark"></div>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-dark font-semibold">02.A — THE AESTHETIC HERITAGE</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-obsidian font-semibold">{corp.founders.elena.name}</h3>
          <p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-obsidian/45 font-semibold">{corp.founders.elena.experience}</p>
          
          <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed space-y-4 font-sans font-light">
            <p>
              Having spent more than forty years guiding Calgary's elite through the nuances of European luxury fashion as co-owner of La Chic, Elena understands that true luxury is defined by things that are felt but unseen: the precise fall of a drape, the authenticity of a texture, and the hierarchy of proportions.
            </p>
            <p>
              She carries this uncompromising eye directly into IKOS. Every selection—from raw travertine blocks harvested in private Italian quarries to hand-applied Marmorino plaster formulated to age gracefully—must pass her rigorous design curation. Her approach is editorial, ensuring that every room acts as a balanced piece of art.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stamos's Side -->
        <div class="space-y-4 bg-white/60 border border-bronze/10 p-8 relative group hover:border-bronze-dark transition-all duration-500">
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-1.5 h-0.5 bg-bronze-dark"></div>
          <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-bronze-dark font-semibold">02.B — THE OPERATIONAL HERITAGE</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-serif text-obsidian font-semibold">{corp.founders.stamos.name}</h3>
          <p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-obsidian/45 font-semibold">{corp.founders.stamos.experience}</p>
          
          <div class="text-xs md:text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed space-y-4 font-sans font-light">
            <p>
              With over thirty years navigating the mathematical disciplines of financial risk, capital management, and structural execution, Stamos operates on a plane of absolute scheduling and financial transparency. To Stamos, a luxury design is only as grand as its structural execution and financial integrity.
            </p>
            <p>
              He engineered the proprietary IKOS project management matrix, which maps out every concrete pour, steel shipment, and material transit file down to the hour. This eliminates the volatility, delay, and quality dilution typical of residential construction. At IKOS, Stamos represents structural immortality and bulletproof delivery.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE EXCLUSIVE DIFFERENTIATOR -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-linen relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 overflow-hidden border border-bronze/10 aspect-[4/3] bg-white">
        <img 
          src="https://ikosluxurydevelopments.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/IKOS-Living-17-WMK.jpg" 
          alt="Bespoke luxury interior detailing" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-90 hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-1000"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-4">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-epic text-bronze-dark block font-semibold">OUR STRUCTURAL SHIELD</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-obsidian tracking-tight uppercase">{corp.coreDifferentiator.title}</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-obsidian/75 leading-relaxed font-sans font-light">
          {corp.coreDifferentiator.description}
        </p>
        <div class="border-t border-bronze/10 pt-4 mt-6">
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-obsidian/80 font-sans">
              <!-- Inline icon with absolute limits to prevent giant scaling errors -->
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 max-w-5 max-h-4 text-bronze-dark flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
              <span>Direct supply-chain security with European limestone and bronze quarries.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs text-obsidian/80 font-sans">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 max-w-5 max-h-4 text-bronze-dark flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
              <span>Single point of operational accountability from land scanning to landscaping.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONCLUSION / CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white/40 border-t border-bronze/10 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col items-center">
      <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-epic text-bronze-dark font-semibold mb-3">THE REGISTRY IS OPEN</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif text-obsidian mb-4 uppercase">Create Your Architectural Legacy</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-obsidian/60 max-w-xl leading-relaxed font-sans font-light mb-6">
        We invite prospective clients to initiate private consult discussions. We accept only three structural estate commissions annually to preserve our absolute execution quality.
      </p>
      <a href="/inquire" class="bg-obsidian hover:bg-bronze-dark text-linen hover:text-obsidian font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full text-xs uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-300">
        Initiate Commission Consult
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
